# landing-race turned 90 degrees: A (west of R's landing cell) beats Q (north of it). At t4 A
# extends first, Q's push then takes R away, and A retracts in the same block-event phase: X is
# spat one cell down (the east/west failure of sculk-2's s4/s1, tracks/sculk-ew/NOTES.md).
design designs/gadgets/landing-race-turned.txt
probe Q 0 2 0
probe A -1 2 1
probe X -1 1 1
probe Xlow -1 0 1
quiet 50
use 0 1 -1
expect_trace A rrr~~r
expect Q E
expect X .
expect Xlow #
